Windows only: hfcast-engine v2.14.0 (rev f978252) links files with
std::os::unix::fs::symlink; this copies instead where there are no Unix
symlinks, and is identical on Unix. Applied by packaging/windows/build.sh
to a private copy of the engine, never to the one Linux and Android use.
Worth offering upstream.

--- a/src/runner.rs
+++ b/src/runner.rs
